Package: btwctl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-usb
Recommends: python3-pyqt6 | python3-pyside6, libnotify-bin, wireplumber
Conflicts: btw5-switch
Replaces: btw5-switch
Provides: btw5-switch
Description: Control the Creative BT-W5 and BT-W6 Bluetooth audio dongles
 Switch aptX Adaptive between High Quality and Low Latency, turn the headset
 microphone (HFP) on or off, pair and switch between headsets, and get
 notified when a headset connects. Per-headset settings, a game mode and
 automatic switching of the default audio device. Includes a settings
 window, a tray icon and a command line tool.
